WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:01.968
-Nikolaj, it is great
to see you again.

00:00:01.968 --> 00:00:03.767
-Great to see you.

00:00:03.767 --> 00:00:04.801
