and she goes -- [ Gasping ]

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:54.701
And then she found these books
to show me these pictures

00:01:54.701 --> 00:01:56.434
and there was like
all these disgusting images

00:01:56.434 --> 00:01:58.000
and she's like, "It's like this.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:01:59.000
Worse.
Yours is worse."

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:00.234
[ Laughter ]
-Wow!

00:02:00.234 --> 00:02:02.367
-Yeah, it was disgusting.
-Doctor says that, yeah.

00:02:02.367 --> 00:02:03.467
