00:02:26.734 --> 00:02:27.901
[ Laughter ]
-I know.

00:02:27.901 --> 00:02:29.667
-They're so happy
to have you in the hospital.

00:02:29.667 --> 00:02:31.200
Like, "Hey, I'll treat him!"

00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:32.901
[ Laughter ]
"No, no I'll treat him!
I'll rub his legs!"

00:02:32.901 --> 00:02:34.834
"Let me rub his legs.
No, let me rub his back."

00:02:34.834 --> 00:02:36.934
They go, oh, yeah.
They're so psyched.

00:02:36.934 --> 00:02:38.434
-And they really saved me.

00:02:38.434 --> 00:02:40.234
They saved the trip.
I'm so grateful.

00:02:40.234 --> 00:02:42.400
So, if they watch this,
